{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國家航空航天局（NASA）「毅力號」火星車創下新的世界紀錄——它在地外天體表面的行駛裏程，超過了此前所有探測器。10月11日，它的裏程表讀數達到28.10英裏（45.22公裏），超越了此前由「機遇號」保持的28.06英裏（45.16公裏）紀錄。「機遇號」於2004至2018年間在火星開展探測。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583476.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.919034+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:19:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"86f8c04e4a67ba25d1eaad9a816673fa3704dbe6e9b9d58084047d0da953dbed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}